00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.940
<i>What is this sensation?</i>

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.860
<i>It's the same as earlier.</i>

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:53.430
<i>It feels like a dream, but it's real.</i>

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:58.640
<i>Right now, I'm no longer Ooki Futaba.</i>

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.960
<i>No, I am the hero that will save Pikari! {## oh this is a weird one}</i>

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:08.410
Hold on! Everyone, please direct your attention over there!

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:11.760
The blooming white lily of the valley has a slight lead!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:15.160
Which of the two flowers will break the line first?!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.470
Look out!

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:23.930
F—

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:27.400
Finish!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:30.110
They arrived at the same time!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.530
What an emotional and dramatic ending! {}{## oh man, he got im}

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:41.300
Finally found you! Let's head home.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:47.180
I'd like to extend a warm thank-you to everyone who participated in the event! {## nominalizzzzzzation / correct, I checked, so don't go reverting these}

